{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48787","headline":"陪羣公登箕山赋得羣字 · 宋之问","name":"陪羣公登箕山赋得羣字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"许由去已远，冥莫见幽坟。\n世薄人不贵，兹山唯白云。\n宁知三千岁，复有尧爲君。\n时佐激颓俗，登箕挹清芬。\n高节虽旦暮，邈与洪崖羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}